    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n2336" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἴθρη</span></b> , ἡ, <i><span class="en">
			Hom.
		</span></i> and <i><span class="en">
			Ar.
		</span></i> ll.cc.: later <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἴθρα</span></b> ,
			<i><span class="en">
			Antiph.
			52.14
		</span></i>, etc.:—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>clear
				sky</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ποίησον δ᾽ αἴθρην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					17.646
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀλλὰ μάλ᾽ αἴθρη πέπταται ἀνέφελος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					6.44
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Av.</u>
				778
			</span></i> (lyr.), <i><span class="en">
				Lyc.
				700
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				6.179
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Arch.
			</span></i>), etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>air</i>, as an element, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Orac.Chald.</u>
				169
			</span></i>.</div>
